      "text": "ADA Law Society."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.5,
      "end": 5.465,
      "speed": 1.08,
      "text": "Founded in twenty nineteen at ADA University."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.6,
      "end": 9.069,
      "speed": 0.998,
      "text": "Our new home online: your gateway to the legal world."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.25,
      "end": 12.924,
      "speed": 0.989,
      "text": "Law is learned in lecture halls, understood in argument."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.1,
      "end": 17.481,
      "speed": 1.08,
      "text": "Competitions argued before a full bench. Debates that run for weeks."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.55,
      "end": 19.304,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "Every final, on the record."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.3,
      "end": 23.683,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "A seminar is a small room, and a hard question."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.85,
      "end": 32.65,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "The Law Blog: case notes and commentary, written in the language each author thinks in."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.9,
      "end": 35.292,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "Read it. Question it."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.2,
      "end": 40.212,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "The newsroom keeps the record of everything the Society does."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.9,
      "end": 47.967,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "And behind it, the people: a board and four committees. Thirty students. One Society."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.5,
      "end": 51.714,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "Since twenty nineteen, the record has only grown."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.6,
      "end": 56.654,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "Now, on every screen, in English, Azerbaijani and Russian."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.75,
      "end": 59.318,
      "speed": 0.9,
      "text": "Come and argue with us."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 62.187,
